OL,3,ACerys Matthews pays tribute to her
OL,4,Afamily as she receives OBE
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger and presenter Cerys Matthews
OL,7,Fpaid tribute to her family as she
OL,8,Freceived an OBE.
OL,10,FMatthews, from Cardiff, was appointed
OL,11,Fan Officer of the Order of the British
OL,12,FEmpire (OBE) for services to music and
OL,13,Freceived a medal from the Prince of
OL,14,FWales.
OL,16,FThe 57-year-old hosts a BBC Radio 6
OL,17,FMusic show every Sunday and was a
OL,18,Ffounding member of Welsh rock band
OL,19,FCatatonia who shot to fame during the
OL,20,F"Cool Cymru" movement of the 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
