OL,3,ACerys Matthews pays tribute to her
OL,4,Afamily as she receives OBE
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after the ceremony, Matthews
OL,7,Fsaid she accepted the OBE in memory of
OL,8,Fher family and "in gratitude of the
OL,9,Ffreedoms I have as a female in this
OL,10,Fera".
